# ServerStatus

|class info|
|:--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|com.huawei.agconnect.cloud.database.ServerStatus ServerStatus类表示云侧服务器状态，当调用CloudDBZone类中的[executeServerStatusQuery](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/clouddb-clouddbzone-0000001081018016#section13707182311265)()方法成功查询云侧服务器状态时才会获取ServerStatus对象。|

## Public Method Summary

|Return type|Method name|
|:----------|:--------------------------------------------------------|
|long|[getServerTimestamp](#section63873341446)() 获取云侧服务器当前时间戳。|

## Public Methods

### getServerTimestamp

|Method|
|:--------------------------------------------------|
|public long getServerTimestamp() 调用此方法获取云侧服务器当前时间戳。|

**Return**

|type|desc|
|:---|:----------|
|long|云侧服务器当前时间戳。|

